\f0\fs24 \cf0 Your volume, minus the noise.\
\
You know the dance. On the train, a tunnel roars and you can't hear your podcast, so you turn it up. The train stops, the roar vanishes, and now it's blasting so you turn it down. Caf\'e9, gym, plane, sidewalk: all day, your thumb does a job a machine should be doing.\
ENVO is that machine. It listens to the noise around you and gently levels your volume to match: up when the world gets loud, back down when it quiets so what you're hearing stays in the same comfortable place. You set the volume. ENVO keeps it right.\
\
HOW IT WORKS\
Once a second, ENVO takes a loudness snapshot of your surroundings through the microphone. It works out how loud the room truly is, then eases your volume up or down by a small, safe amount. Your chosen level is always the baseline. The instant you touch the volume buttons, that becomes the new normal. You are never fighting the app.\
\
BUILT ON REAL PSYCHOACOUSTICS\
\'95 Thinks in decibels, the way your ears actually perceive loudness so an adjustment feels the same whether you started quiet or loud.\
\'95 Defends against the Lombard Effect. The reason a restaurant slowly gets deafening as people raise their voices to be heard. ENVO recognizes when noise is just voices and refuses to chase it into your ears.\
\'95 Rejects transients. A door slam or a dropped tray is loud but brief, and ENVO shrugs it off instead of jumping.\
\
ROOM CALIBRATION\
A 30-second calibration teaches ENVO how your own speaker sounds to the mic, so it can subtract your playback and measure only the real ambient noise. No more feedback loops where the volume drifts up on its own.\
\
SAFETY FIRST\
ENVO is engineered so it can't run away with your ears:\
\'95 A hard ceiling it will never exceed.\
\'95 A range cap (\'b13, \'b16, or \'b19 dB) you choose.\
\'95 Smooth, rate-limited changes, never a sudden jump.\
\'95 Your manual volume change always wins, instantly.\
\
WORKS EVERYWHERE YOU DO\
Commutes, caf\'e9s, open-plan offices, flights, the gym, cooking at home, a bar that's filling up. ENVO runs quietly in the background with any audio app - Music, Spotify, Podcasts, YouTube, audiobooks, calls - and keeps hi-fi stereo on your Bluetooth headphones while sensing the room with the built-in mic.\
\
HANDS-FREE\
Start and stop with Siri, the Action Button, or Shortcuts automations. Turn it on when you leave the house and forget it's there.\
\
PRIVATE BY DESIGN\
No audio is ever recorded, stored, or transmitted. Only instantaneous sound levels are measured in memory and immediately discarded. Everything runs on your device. No account, no server, no analytics, no data collection. Calibration stays local to your iPhone.\
\
CONTROLS\
\'95 RESPONSE \'97 how fast ENVO reacts (SLOW / MED / FAST).\
\'95 RANGE \'97 how far it's allowed to adjust (\'b13 / \'b16 / \'b19 dB).\
\'95 DIRECTION \'97 allow volume up, down, or both.\
\'95 CALIBRATE \'97 full room setup, or a 5-second quick refresh.\
\
ENVO reads your environment so your ears don't have to.\
\
